<title>GREECE: ATHENS BOURSE OK'S HELLENIC INVEST RIGHTS ISSUE.</title>
<headline>ATHENS BOURSE OK'S HELLENIC INVEST RIGHTS ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens bourse approved the 6.41 billion drachma rights issue by closed-end fund Hellenic Investments, it said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The fund will issue 3,375,000 new common bearer shares at 1,900 drachmas. The terms will be three new shares per 10 outstanding. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
